# Faithless Looting (paid with Black Lotus) discards Bloodbraid Challenger and an Island on turn 1, so the graveyard holds
# the Challenger and three other cards (Lotus, Looting, Island). On turn 3 Bot1 casts it from the graveyard for its escape
# cost {3}{R}{G} (four Moxen and the turn's Forest), exiling three other cards (CR 702.138a). Cascade still triggers on the
# escaped cast (CR 702.85a) and casts Lightning Bolt at Bot2; haste lets it attack at once: 20 - 3 - 4 = 13.

